            "description": {
              "value": "Razor-sharp slivers of metal fall from the sky. Each creature in a 20-foot burst within 60 feet takes 9d6 slashing damage with a basic Reflex save against your class DC. The razors embed in all surfaces in the area, making them hazardous terrain for 1 minute. A creature that moves through this hazardous terrain takes 3 slashing damage for every square of the area it moves into."
